<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Nov CPI up 0.4 pct mo/mo, +5.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak Nov CPI up 0.4 pct mo/mo, +5.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak consumer prices in November rose 0.4 percent, month-on-month, putting prices 5.4 percent higher over the same month of the previous year, the Slovak Statitstical Bureau (SUSR) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION   NOV 96     OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		0.4	  0.7	  0.4</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		5.4	  5.3	  7.6</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
